 kit new - makes a new file, or a new kind, rule, package, template, or verb

   one of required
   file      makes a file from a template
   kind      makes a kind of file
   rule      makes a rule for a kind
   style     makes a style for a kind
   package   makes a package of the repository's own
   template  makes a template, listed in its package's rule or style
   module    makes a bash module, or a jq module with --jq
   provider  makes a provider of a seam
   verb      makes a verb of the kit
   issue     opens the page that files a new issue in a tracker


 kit new
